  <History Date="30-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="30-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches" />
  <History Date="30-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed raw colour DMX range.  Added missing Gobo 2 raw option.  Fixed 16bit raw display ranges." />
  <History Date="30-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased 16bit wheel resolution.  Added highlight/lowlight.  Standardised conditionals." />
  <History Date="30-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed duplicate macros and fixed." />
